HHIISSTTOORRYY
     A rotor-based ccrryypptt() function appeared in Version 6 AT&T UNIX.  The cur‐
     rent style ccrryypptt() first appeared in Version 7 AT&T UNIX.

     The DES section of the code (FreeSec 1.0) was developed outside the
     United States of America as an unencumbered replacement for the U.S.-only
     NetBSD libcrypt encryption library.

     The ccrryypptt__rr() function was added in FreeBSD 12.0.

